---
description: Universal pipeline rules for every role and session
alwaysApply: true
---

Fail loudly. Raise typed errors from `core.errors`. No silent fallbacks or coercion.

Never invent citations, constants, formulas or APIs. Cite only keys in
`governance/references.bib` with a vault-verified location. Otherwise write
`## [NEEDS-SOURCE: …]` or `## [ASSUMPTION: Ax]` and stop.

Never edit frozen specs or the ledger by hand. Do not open the test split in
exploratory mode. Stay in your role's write paths. One phase per session.

Show exit-command output. Human gates (references.bib, verified items, unfreeze,
prereg, findings, claims) are for the human only.

`DEEPSEEK_API_KEY` is an env var only; never write it to disk.
